              {
                "field": "facility.criteria_pte_major",
                "op": "is_false"
              }
            ]
          },
          "verdict": "check_with_ehs",
          "why": "Not major on the facts given, but an NSPS or NESHAP can still require a title V permit (§ 70.3(a)(2)-(3), (b)). Check the rules flagged above."
